Z||000002||Mach10||10-07-2001||09:10 PM||||UT is a computer game (Unreal Tournament). It's a first-person shooter (like doom) who's main screen with HUD looks kinda like that. among some fancy sci-fi weapons (including a rail-gun and a predator-eque sawblade shooter) it has a weapon called a redeemer. It's basically a HUGE shoulder-mounted missile that packs a (barely) sub-nuclear explosion. The resulting shockwave is both deadly and very pretty to look at. Can you spell "C-H-U-N-K-Y-S-A-L-S-A?" <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
